  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/19Qp4kN7C-BYav_y86yTBpNL4R1QxDHkuUYMxVnr7Rc.original.fullsize.png\"/>\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& h=-a e, k=b, \\quad \\frac{a}{e}-a e=4 \\Rightarrow a\\left(1-e^2\\right)=4 e \\Rightarrow \\frac{b^2}{a}=4 e \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow b^2=4 a e \\Rightarrow k^2=-4 h \\Rightarrow y^2=-4 x\n\\end{aligned}$\nWhich is a general conic and satisfying the condition of parabola.",
